# core.autocrlf=true rewrites checkouts to CRLF, which breaks every tool that
# reads a file byte-wise: the gates checker parsing gates.env, shell scripts,
# and Prettier, which would otherwise report all 182 files as unformatted after
# a fresh clone. Normalise the whole tree to LF instead of teaching each tool
# to tolerate both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so no line ending handling at all.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
